/**
 * IWAC Visualizations — Albani Zaria sermons block: translations.
 *
 * Every string this block reads, and only this block, so they travel in its
 * own bundle (built once per locale). The Hausa and Arabic of the corpus are
 * never translated here: lexicon glosses come from the generator's bundle
 * (`gloss_en` / `gloss_fr`) and are curatorial aids beside the term, not a
 * replacement for it.
 *
 * Written for a general reader. A 20-minute unit of a transcript is a
 * "segment" everywhere, and "window" never names it, because the
 * collocation span (words on either side of a term) needs the plainer word.
 *
 * Registered at parse time, before the panels and the orchestrator load.
 */
